<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr" data-theme="dark">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Réinitialiser le mot de passe — PathFinder</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@400;600;700&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html,body{height:100%;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif}
body{min-height:100vh;background:#09090f;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px}
.card{width:100%;max-width:460px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:24px;padding:40px}
h1{font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;font-size:24px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px}
p{color:rgba(232,230,240,.65);font-size:14px;margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6}
label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(232,230,240,.6);margin-bottom:6px;text-transform:uppercase}
input{width:100%;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:#e8e6f0;outline:none;margin-bottom:12px}
.btn{margin-top:6px;width:100%;padding:13px;border:none;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6C63FF,#9D6BFF);color:#fff;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
.msg{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:12px}
.err{background:rgba(226,75,74,.12);border:.5px solid rgba(226,75,74,.35);color:#f87171}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
  <h1>Nouveau mot de passe</h1>
  <p>Choisissez un nouveau mot de passe sécurisé pour votre compte.</p>

  {% for m in app.flashes('error') %}<div class="msg err">{{ m }}</div>{% endfor %}

  <form method="post" novalidate>
    <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('reset_password') }}">
    <input type="hidden" name="email" value="{{ email }}">
    <input type="hidden" name="token" value="{{ token }}">

    <label for="password">Nouveau mot de passe</label>
    <input id="password" type="password" name="password" minlength="6" required placeholder="Minimum 6 caractères">

    <label for="password_confirm">Confirmer le mot de passe</label>
    <input id="password_confirm" type="password" name="password_confirm" minlength="6" required placeholder="Répétez le mot de passe">

    <button class="btn" type="submit">Réinitialiser</button>
  </form>
</div>
</body>
</html>
